7′-Methoxy-3′,4′-dihydro-2′H-spiro[cyclohexane-1,1′-isoquinolin]-6′-ol
(21). The compound is prepared according to general procedure A. Calcium
1,1,1,3,3,3-hexafluoroisopropoxide (78.2 mg, 0.209 mmol, 20.4 mol %) was
reacted with 3-hydroxy-4-methoxyphenethylamine (171 mg, 1.02 mmol) and
cyclohexanone (103.5 mg, 1.05 mmol) in DCM (10 mL) for 24 h at ambient
temperature to give the product 21 (212 mg, 0.856 mmol, 84%) as an
off-white solid. 1H NMR(400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 1.22-1.36 (m, 1H), 1.60-1.80
(m, 9H), 2.66 (t, J = 6.0 Hz, 2H), 3.02 (t, J = 6.0 Hz, 2H), 3.88 (s,
3H), 6.60 (s, 1H), 6.72 (s, 1H); 13C NMR(100 MHz, CDCl3): δ 22.0, 25.9,
38.3, 38.6, 54.5, 56.3, 108.5, 114.8, 128.2, 136.6, 143.8, 145.1; IR
(KBr): 3308, 3010, 2929, 2843, 2591, 1607, 1528, 1450, 1331, 1255, 1216,
1121, 1043, 839, 779. HRMS (ESI): calcd for C15H21NO2 [M + H]+ 248.1645,
found 248.1637.
