$DATUM 2-(2-Methoxycarbonyl-ethyl)-1-methyl-2,3,4,9-tetrahydro-1H-β-carboline-1-carboxylic
acidmethyl ester (5). TFA (0.81 mL, 11 mmol) was added to a solution of 8
(1.29 g, 5.24 mmol) and methyl pyruvate (0.71 mL, 7.9 mmol) in dry MeOH
(20 mL). The mixture was heated at reflux for 4 days, cooled to room
temperature, and concentrated. The residue was diluted with water,
basified with NH3.H2O to pH 9, and extracted with EtOAc. The combined
extracts were dried over Na2SO4,filtered, and concentrated to give a
residue, which was chromatographed on silica gel (hexanes/EtOAc,3:1) to
provide 5 (1.30 g) as a yellow oil.
2-(2-Methoxycarbonyl-ethyl)-1-methyl-2,3,4,9-tetrahydro-1H-β-carboline-1-carboxylic
acid methyl ester (5), yield 75%. 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz) δ 1.70 (s, 3H),
2.59 (t, J =6.9 Hz, 2H), 2.75-2.79 (m, 2H), 2.94-3.24 (m, 4H), 3.67 (s,
3H), 3.72 (s, 3H), 7.09 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H),7.17 (t, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H),
7.31 (d, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 7.49 (d, J = 7.8 Hz, 1H), 8.03 (br s, 1H ); 13C
NMR(CDCl3, 75 MHz) δ 21.7, 23.3, 34.9, 45.2, 47.0, 51.5, 52.2, 63.7,
109.8, 110.9, 118.4, 119.3, 122.0,126.6, 133.4, 136.2, 172.9, 174.2. MS
(EI) 330 (M+, 0.3), 271 (100), 183 (9), 115 (2). HRMS (MALDI) Calcd. for
C18H23N2O4 (M + 1)+ 331.1652. Found: 331.1650.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Pictet-Spengler cyclization
